notes['104']='Partial raw-body review only: lines 1–135, 1100–1145 and 18280–18313 (215/18,313). Complete parsed population has 1,069 records, 973 general_obstruction entries, 29 admitted/1,040 candidate labels, and two embedded admissions. All 973 share exact description/bad/good string templates; this is automated template accounting, not adjudication of every distinct declaration. Root comparison covers 60 previously fully read JSON bodies: 32 equal records, 14 differing records and 14 absent IDs, with all reported field deltas read. Individual catalog-only prose, evidence binding, regex semantics and causal independence remain unreviewed. Two managed v2 projections match their full-read candidates; legacy mathematical answers must not become new task truth. Preserve historical catalog; consolidate through independently admitted definitions after dual-control validation. Reconciles prior EPR06/EPR14, not a new learned-mechanism count.'
notes['144']='Partial raw-body review: 756/759 lines read, omitting only long embedded build-output lines 221, 240 and 478. Full JSON parsed; all 18 final records, six original failures, three mutation sequences, 16 link repairs, six retained obligations and all surrounding status/binding context read. Historical status is IMPLEMENTED_BOUNDED_FULL_GOAL_BLOCKED, with 14 zero/2 one/2 two final exit statuses. All three mutation digests restore their declared baselines. Whole-population exact UTF-8 output hashing reproduces prior EPR13: 21/33 pairs differ. Stored outputs and QA links are not current-byte authenticated; historical normalization/original artifacts remain unresolved, not evidence of fabrication. Missing trust root, independent review, global paths, Unicode/platform coverage and full-programme work stay explicitly open. No retained command was executed.'
# Correct population from actual checked result, rather than relying on hand-entered arithmetic.
