md += ['## Reproduction and limits','', 'Run only the review helpers: `.venv/Scripts/python.exe -B -X utf8 dag/reviews/additional_eis_artifacts_remaining_controls.py` and the separately supplied validation helper. The controls are not production tests. The catalog inspection helper is read-only with respect to originals and writes only its own prefix.','', 'All source pins and evidence ranges are validated separately. No efficacy claim follows from stored self-scores, status labels, matching identities or mutation exit codes.']
